WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:03.500
Let's go next to our caller from the two to
four area code.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.410
Who's calling today from two to four.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.069
Hey, it was me.

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:09.460
Yes it is.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.460
Okay.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.460
Hey David.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:16.830
I was talking to my friends about foreign
policy, especially in regards to Iran and

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:22.189
how the Trump and configurations can save
a rattling pretty much their entire time and

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:27.920
Bolton being gone a bit of a reassurance,
but with this fiasco, with the oil fields

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:34.410
and Saudi Arabia and they're placing us troops
to guard those oil fields, almost like bait.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.820
Yeah.

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:38.780
It seems like we're continuing to build up
now.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:45.980
I'd heard that if since war with Iran is such
an unpopular idea, the Trump administration

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.620
is actually waiting until after reelection.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.180
Do you think that's possible?

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:52.521
Do you think that's possible?

00:00:52.521 --> 00:00:53.620
That's totally possible.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:57.379
It's also possible that Donald Trump, I mean,
Trump doesn't always listen to advice.

00:00:57.379 --> 00:01:02.180
He may say, Oh, well, a war will help me win
reelection in 2020 so we shouldn't underestimate

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.770
the possibility that he would escalate sooner
as a result of that.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:09.650
But yeah, I mean, I, I, you know, initially
when people saw Bolton leaving who were saying,

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:11.660
Oh, now there's no chance of a war with Iran.

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:12.660
No, no, no.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:14.360
There, it could be under different circumstances.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:18.700
It could be motivated in different ways, but
I don't think that threat of war with Iran

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.640
is gone now that John Bolton has gone.

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.310
I completely agree with you.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:23.310
Yeah.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:24.310
All right.

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:25.310
Thank you.

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:26.490
Okay, thanks.

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:28.290
I appreciate it.

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.160
It sounded like he was on speaker, but it
was good enough.

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:32.010
I figured I wouldn't interrupt with that.

